apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
Intestazioni: apns-topic: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: alert, apns-collapse-id: room:42
Corpo: {aps: {alert: {title, body}}, dati: <sealed>}

